 "title": "Kontakt",
 "content": "<p><!-- KONTAKT PAGE --></p>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; color:#1A1F2E; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 24px; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap:break-word;\">\n<p>  <!-- HEADER --></p>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4DC49A;margin-bottom:14px;\"><br />\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:20px;height:1.5px;background:#6EDAB4;\"></span><br />\n      Kontakt<br />\n    </span></p>\n<h1 style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(22px,4vw,40px);font-weight:700;color:#1A1F2E;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:16px;word-break:break-word;\">\n      Wir sind für dich da.<br />\n    </h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:#5A6478;line-height:1.75;max-width:520px;\">\n      Fragen zu Produkten, Bestellungen oder COAs? Schreib uns — wir antworten in der Regel innerhalb von 24 Stunden.\n    </p>\n<div style=\"width:40px;height:2.5px;background:#6EDAB4;border-radius:2px;margin-top:20px;\"></div>\n</p></div>\n<p>  <!-- LAYOUT --></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:start;\">\n<p>    <!-- LINKS --></p>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:300px;\">\n<p>      <!-- E-Mail Card --></p>\n<div style=\"background:#F7FAFB;border:1px solid #E4EBF0;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\n<div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FBF7;border:1px solid #D4F3E8;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4DC49A\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1F2E;margin-bottom:2px;\">E-Mail Support</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8A9BB0;\">Antwort innerhalb von 24h</div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<p>        <a href=\"mailto:support@aminolabspro.com\" style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#4DC49A;\">support@aminolabspro.com</a>\n      </div>\n<p>      <!-- Versand Card --></p>\n<div style=\"background:#F7FAFB;border:1px solid #E4EBF0;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\n<div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FBF7;border:1px solid #D4F3E8;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4DC49A\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\"/><polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1F2E;margin-bottom:2px;\">Versand</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8A9BB0;\">Aus Deutschland</div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#5A6478;line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">\n          Bestellungen bis 14:00 Uhr werden noch am selben Werktag versandt. Lieferzeit DE 2-4 Werktage.\n        </p>\n</p></div>\n<p>      <!-- COA Card --></p>\n<div style=\"background:#F7FAFB;border:1px solid #E4EBF0;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\n<div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background:#F0FBF7;border:1px solid #D4F3E8;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4DC49A\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1F2E;margin-bottom:2px;\">COA Anfragen</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8A9BB0;\">Batch-Nummer bereithalten</div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#5A6478;line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">\n          COAs sind öffentlich auf unserer <a href=\"/coa\" style=\"color:#4DC49A;font-weight:500;\">COA-Seite</a> abrufbar. Bei spezifischen Fragen gerne per E-Mail.\n        </p>\n</p></div>\n<p>      <!-- Disclaimer --></p>\n<div style=\"background:#F0FBF7;border:1px solid #D4F3E8;border-left:3px solid #6EDAB4;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 20px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#5A6478;line-height:1.65;margin:0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#2E8B6E;\">Hinweis:</strong> Wir geben keine Beratung zu Anwendung, Dosierung oder therapeutischem Gebrauch unserer Produkte. Alle Produkte sind ausschließlich für Forschungszwecke bestimmt.\n        </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<p>    <!-- RECHTS: Formular --></p>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:300px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F7FAFB;border:1px solid #E4EBF0;border-radius:14px;padding:32px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1F2E;margin-bottom:8px;\">Nachricht senden</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8A9BB0;margin-bottom:24px;\">Wir melden uns so schnell wie möglich.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f140-o1\" lang=\"de-DE\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"140\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/43#wpcf7-f140-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Kontaktformular\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"140\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.7\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"de_DE\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f140-o1\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n</fieldset>\n<p><label> Dein Name<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"your-name\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required\" autocomplete=\"name\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" /></span> </label>\n</p>\n<p><label> Deine E-Mail-Adresse<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"your-email\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" /></span> </label>\n</p>\n<p><label> Betreff<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"your-subject\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"your-subject\" /></span> </label>\n</p>\n<p><label> Deine Nachricht (optional)<br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"your-message\"><textarea cols=\"40\" rows=\"10\" maxlength=\"2000\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea\" aria-invalid=\"false\" name=\"your-message\"></textarea></span> </label>\n</p>\n<p><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Senden\" />\n</p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.wpcf7-form input[type=\"text\"],<br />\n.wpcf7-form input[type=\"email\"],<br />\n.wpcf7-form textarea {<br />\n  width: 100% !important;<br />\n  background: #fff !important;<br />\n  border: 1.5px solid #E4EBF0 !important;<br />\n  border-radius: 8px !important;<br />\n  padding: 12px 16px !important;<br />\n  font-size: 15px !important;<br />\n  color: #1A1F2E !important;<br />\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;<br />\n  outline: none !important;<br />\n  transition: border-color</p>\n",
